# FINANCE CLARIFICATION GATE

The supplied finance baseline is not a complete accounting specification.

If a requested change introduces behavior not already specified, ask before implementation.

Examples requiring clarification:
- ledger/journal design;
- tax/GST;
- discounts beyond scholarship;
- refunds approval workflow;
- write-offs;
- installments beyond approved terms;
- payroll;
- reconciliation;
- financial periods;
- currencies;
- accounting entries;
- settlement rules.

Do not fill gaps with assumptions.
